{"id":"38bccd77c29488bb","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-heyting-chain.md","title":"Heyting Chain","display":"Heyting Chain","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-heyting-chain","aliases":["93-fact-heyting-chain"],"display":"Heyting Chain","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-heyting]]","[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-heyting-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-heyting-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Heyting Chain"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" href=\"?note=edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" title=\"93-df-heyting\">93-df-heyting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-heyting-chain-—-Heyting-Chain\">fact-heyting-chain — Heyting Chain</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge 2\">\\(n\\ge 2\\)</span>, and the carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n\">\\(C_n\\)</span> is defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HMeet}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{HMeet}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HJoin}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{HJoin}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HImp}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{HImp}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HZero}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{HZero}_{93,n}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HOne}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{HOne}_{93,n}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HOpFam}_{93,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{HOpFam}_{93,n}\\)</span> are the explicit operation graphs defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the Heyting-algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" href=\"?note=edc4ffdba40ef7c6\" title=\"93-df-heyting\">93-df-heyting</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nC_n\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\omega:j&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nC_n\\coloneqq\\{j\\in\\omega:j&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HMeet}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\min\\{x,y\\}\\rangle:x,y\\in C_n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HMeet}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\min\\{x,y\\}\\rangle:x,y\\in C_n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HJoin}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\max\\{x,y\\}\\rangle:x,y\\in C_n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HJoin}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\max\\{x,y\\}\\rangle:x,y\\in C_n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HImp}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}n-1,&amp;x\\leq y,\\\\y,&amp;y&lt;x\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in C_n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HImp}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}n-1,&amp;x\\leq y,\\\\y,&amp;y&lt;x\\end{cases}\n\\right\\rangle:x,y\\in C_n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HZero}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{HOne}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,n-1\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HZero}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{HOne}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,n-1\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HOpFam}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{HMeet}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{HJoin}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{HImp}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{HZero}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{HOne}_{93,n}\\rangle\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HOpFam}_{93,n}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle\\wedge,\\operatorname{HMeet}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\vee,\\operatorname{HJoin}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle\\to,\\operatorname{HImp}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle0,\\operatorname{HZero}_{93,n}\\rangle,\n\\langle1,\\operatorname{HOne}_{93,n}\\rangle\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathbf C_n\\coloneqq\\langle C_n,\\operatorname{HOpFam}_{93,n}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathbf C_n\\coloneqq\\langle C_n,\\operatorname{HOpFam}_{93,n}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge2\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf C_n)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C_n\\;(x\\leq_{\\mathbf C_n^-}y\n\\lor y\\leq_{\\mathbf C_n^-}x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}heyting\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge2\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HeytAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf C_n)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in C_n\\;(x\\leq_{\\mathbf C_n^-}y\n\\lor y\\leq_{\\mathbf C_n^-}x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Every finite chain becomes a Heyting algebra under the displayed explicit\noperation graphs. The converse is false: finite Heyting algebras need not be\nchains (the four-element Boolean algebra is a counterexample).</p>\n","he